                        "entry_id": "5bf5ab06-2f43-39d3-a455-100af9b6e8df",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The structure in a plant that develops into a seed after fertilization; the megasporangium of a seed plant with its enclosing integuments."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
